[
  {
    "text": "Yeah, good morning, good day everyone.",
    "start": 0.96,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Just sitting here",
    "start": 9.44,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "quietly in the silence to",
    "start": 11.84,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "uh see the chat messages flowing",
    "start": 15.599,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "through. There is a kind of warmth in my",
    "start": 19.84,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "heart",
    "start": 23.359,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and so",
    "start": 25.519,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "happy happy to be here with you all",
    "start": 27.599,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "again and this uh 7:00 Pacific time.",
    "start": 30.32,
    "duration": 8.759
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh",
    "start": 36.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "quite a peaceful morning around me here",
    "start": 40.079,
    "duration": 7.721
  },
  {
    "text": "uh in my own room.",
    "start": 43.92,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "So this week um",
    "start": 48.399,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "I've been sharing some reflections",
    "start": 51.68,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "related to",
    "start": 53.84,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "water flow of water flow of life",
    "start": 56.239,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 60.879,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "floods that can come from time to time",
    "start": 62.399,
    "duration": 9.441
  },
  {
    "text": "and how we cross the flood.",
    "start": 67.28,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "And so this last few days, we've kind of",
    "start": 71.84,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "been going with the suta",
    "start": 75.68,
    "duration": 9.04
  },
  {
    "text": "uh uh unfolding the suta as a way to",
    "start": 79.04,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "develop cultivate",
    "start": 84.72,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "a kind of a capacity for us to cross the",
    "start": 87.28,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "flood.",
    "start": 91.52,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And so we started by stepping into the",
    "start": 93.04,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "flow of our lives",
    "start": 97.36,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and learning to stay",
    "start": 100.56,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "in the current in the flow",
    "start": 103.84,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "with some calm some steadiness.",
    "start": 107.36,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "So yesterday",
    "start": 111.439,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "uh we spoke about cultivating stability",
    "start": 113.28,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "uh steadiness",
    "start": 118.399,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "in being with the flow of life",
    "start": 120.799,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "whether there are pleasant unpleasant",
    "start": 124.479,
    "duration": 8.92
  },
  {
    "text": "difficulties, challenges or joys.",
    "start": 127.52,
    "duration": 5.879
  },
  {
    "text": "And then today",
    "start": 134.16,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh we're going to deepen even further as",
    "start": 136.64,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "this suta unfolds.",
    "start": 139.52,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And that is as we become steady with our",
    "start": 142.08,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "experience",
    "start": 146.0,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "more and more things can get nuanced.",
    "start": 148.8,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "We can become attuned to various effects",
    "start": 152.879,
    "duration": 9.921
  },
  {
    "text": "that our activities, our efforts,",
    "start": 158.56,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "our movements in our minds and hearts",
    "start": 162.8,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "have on us.",
    "start": 165.44,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And through being attuned to the effects",
    "start": 168.64,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "of the activities and the movements,",
    "start": 172.8,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "we can begin to learn and to make",
    "start": 176.8,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "choices.",
    "start": 180.56,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "may be wise wholesome choices",
    "start": 182.4,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "to guide us to cross the flood.",
    "start": 186.48,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "So this word attuning",
    "start": 190.64,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "becoming attentive to our experience",
    "start": 193.84,
    "duration": 7.759
  },
  {
    "text": "and so this is what uh we are going to",
    "start": 198.4,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "uh practice with. It's a continuity from",
    "start": 201.599,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "what we've been doing.",
    "start": 205.68,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "Um and you can stay with what we've been",
    "start": 208.319,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "doing also but if this attuning becomes",
    "start": 210.879,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "a available to us",
    "start": 214.4,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "uh allow that to come forth as well in",
    "start": 217.519,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "the practice.",
    "start": 220.319,
    "duration": 8.681
  },
  {
    "text": "So here we go. Let's sit together.",
    "start": 223.04,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe taking a few long deep breaths",
    "start": 236.48,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "as you breathe out.",
    "start": 242.64,
    "duration": 3.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Entering",
    "start": 247.599,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "entering into",
    "start": 250.48,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "your lived experience",
    "start": 253.28,
    "duration": 6.679
  },
  {
    "text": "inside",
    "start": 256.959,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "a kind of entering into an inner temple.",
    "start": 261.84,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe the body",
    "start": 272.08,
    "duration": 6.2
  },
  {
    "text": "breath.",
    "start": 275.28,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We are arriving.",
    "start": 282.88,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Arriving at here and now",
    "start": 287.36,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "where the life unfolds.",
    "start": 294.08,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "This moment",
    "start": 300.639,
    "duration": 3.241
  },
  {
    "text": "being present.",
    "start": 321.44,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "Sati",
    "start": 328.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It's got a flavor of a inner value.",
    "start": 336.8,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "We're valuing being present.",
    "start": 342.0,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "It's valuable to be present",
    "start": 346.16,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "here and now.",
    "start": 350.96,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "Your heart knows.",
    "start": 354.0,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Here",
    "start": 357.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "you can deeply feel,",
    "start": 375.6,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "deeply know",
    "start": 379.039,
    "duration": 3.561
  },
  {
    "text": "life",
    "start": 382.96,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "with all its dimensions.",
    "start": 385.28,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "ities and layers.",
    "start": 387.36,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "gathering, centering around mindfulness,",
    "start": 414.72,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "letting sati",
    "start": 422.56,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "become established.",
    "start": 425.12,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to whatever degree that may be available",
    "start": 430.479,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "right now.",
    "start": 433.599,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "We're not in a hurry.",
    "start": 445.28,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "It's an unhurried",
    "start": 452.639,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "presence.",
    "start": 455.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Not jumping to the next moment.",
    "start": 461.12,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Let this moment of experience",
    "start": 473.759,
    "duration": 8.601
  },
  {
    "text": "become full.",
    "start": 478.479,
    "duration": 3.881
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe the felt sense of the breath",
    "start": 496.24,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "can become full.",
    "start": 500.0,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "You can sense the beginning, the middle,",
    "start": 508.24,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "and the end.",
    "start": 510.879,
    "duration": 3.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Or maybe you can register a range of",
    "start": 529.12,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "experience",
    "start": 533.839,
    "duration": 5.241
  },
  {
    "text": "in the body.",
    "start": 535.519,
    "duration": 3.561
  },
  {
    "text": "There may be a sense of becoming steady,",
    "start": 562.56,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "stable,",
    "start": 570.64,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "grounded",
    "start": 572.959,
    "duration": 5.401
  },
  {
    "text": "in the mindfulness.",
    "start": 574.8,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "It has various effects in us",
    "start": 594.56,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "in the body,",
    "start": 598.959,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "heart and mind.",
    "start": 601.279,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe the heart feels open.",
    "start": 621.36,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Mind is spacious",
    "start": 629.68,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and quiet.",
    "start": 632.399,
    "duration": 3.361
  },
  {
    "text": "Might the body",
    "start": 647.68,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "be a little more at ease. Peace.",
    "start": 649.92,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "The aliveness",
    "start": 686.88,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "may come forth",
    "start": 690.079,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "like a energetic aliveness.",
    "start": 693.279,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "There may be more sensitivity",
    "start": 712.16,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "that's available here.",
    "start": 714.88,
    "duration": 7.959
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can be attuned",
    "start": 718.8,
    "duration": 4.039
  },
  {
    "text": "to your experience.",
    "start": 724.32,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "feeling and sensing being attuned.",
    "start": 789.279,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "It's more like things are clarified",
    "start": 798.32,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "or clear,",
    "start": 803.2,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "crisp,",
    "start": 806.48,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "a little bit or a lot.",
    "start": 811.92,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "There is not a one way.",
    "start": 819.44,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "You may start out",
    "start": 892.639,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "unhurried,",
    "start": 895.199,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "energetic,",
    "start": 901.6,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "alive.",
    "start": 904.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And you may notice the mind may",
    "start": 908.399,
    "duration": 8.921
  },
  {
    "text": "move towards hurrying",
    "start": 912.8,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "or sluggishness.",
    "start": 918.16,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not something wrong.",
    "start": 926.16,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "You're just curious.",
    "start": 931.76,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "about the phenomenon.",
    "start": 934.0,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "What's the effect of this?",
    "start": 942.48,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "a deeper part of ourselves, the",
    "start": 973.04,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "intuitive part of ourselves",
    "start": 976.079,
    "duration": 4.521
  },
  {
    "text": "can naturally",
    "start": 983.44,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "respond",
    "start": 985.36,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "without fixing,",
    "start": 991.92,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "judging.",
    "start": 994.32,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It starts by being attuned",
    "start": 1004.72,
    "duration": 4.919
  },
  {
    "text": "gently.",
    "start": 1013.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Softly. Okay.",
    "start": 1019.839,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "And from time to time",
    "start": 1511.44,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "you may notice",
    "start": 1514.4,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "the mind had wandered away",
    "start": 1517.76,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and you remember",
    "start": 1520.96,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "ah this moment",
    "start": 1523.36,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "come back to this moment.",
    "start": 1528.08,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And you let yourself register",
    "start": 1534.559,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "in that moment",
    "start": 1538.559,
    "duration": 4.401
  },
  {
    "text": "the effect",
    "start": 1540.799,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "of coming back",
    "start": 1542.96,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "to sati.",
    "start": 1545.84,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometime this feels like",
    "start": 1551.919,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "light has turned on in the room.",
    "start": 1554.96,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "or just woke up.",
    "start": 1562.559,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "It feels like this.",
    "start": 1566.799,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "Coming to the present moment.",
    "start": 1572.64,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And you remember the value of being",
    "start": 1598.64,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "present.",
    "start": 1601.76,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So there is a gathering of a heart,",
    "start": 1611.84,
    "duration": 8.6
  },
  {
    "text": "mind and body together",
    "start": 1615.6,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "here and now.",
    "start": 1620.799,
    "duration": 3.721
  },
  {
    "text": "might there be a kind of a joy to be",
    "start": 1807.279,
    "duration": 5.721
  },
  {
    "text": "present?",
    "start": 1810.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Mind is has some kind of a brightness.",
    "start": 1814.159,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "A heart has a kind of a glow.",
    "start": 1820.08,
    "duration": 4.479
  },
  {
    "text": "body has a kind of vibratory",
    "start": 1824.799,
    "duration": 6.441
  },
  {
    "text": "feeling.",
    "start": 1828.24,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And let this wholesome feeling expand",
    "start": 1834.0,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "and share with others you may encounter.",
    "start": 1842.159,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "May the practice benefit all beings.",
    "start": 1850.0,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1857.07,
    "duration": 10.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you for practicing together",
    "start": 1883.919,
    "duration": 4.281
  },
  {
    "text": "and um",
    "start": 1888.24,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "we will continue uh continue to unfold",
    "start": 1890.72,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "this simile of crossing the flood.",
    "start": 1894.48,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And so uh yesterday I spoke about uh",
    "start": 1898.08,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "this um practicing",
    "start": 1903.2,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "uh you can say maybe instructions or",
    "start": 1906.72,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "attitude that the Buddha offered to uh",
    "start": 1909.6,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "this deity who asked him how did you",
    "start": 1914.32,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "cross the flood? And um the Buddha first",
    "start": 1917.84,
    "duration": 9.679
  },
  {
    "text": "said, \"By not halting and not straining,",
    "start": 1922.0,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "I cross the flat.\"",
    "start": 1927.519,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, it's rather cryptic, right? It's",
    "start": 1930.96,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "what does that mean? So, we unpacked a",
    "start": 1935.84,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "little bit yesterday and the deity, the",
    "start": 1938.08,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "deva was not happy, was not satisfied.",
    "start": 1941.6,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "So, that was the second question. How",
    "start": 1945.6,
    "duration": 6.959
  },
  {
    "text": "did you do that? So the Buddha answered",
    "start": 1948.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "uh to me is kind of even more",
    "start": 1952.559,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "interesting way. So today we'll unpack",
    "start": 1954.96,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "this next line.",
    "start": 1958.0,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "So here is the Buddha's answer.",
    "start": 1960.24,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "So he said when I came to a stand still",
    "start": 1963.84,
    "duration": 9.439
  },
  {
    "text": "friend then I sank but when I struggled",
    "start": 1968.159,
    "duration": 10.0
  },
  {
    "text": "then I got swept away. It is in this way",
    "start": 1973.279,
    "duration": 9.041
  },
  {
    "text": "friend that by not halting, by not",
    "start": 1978.159,
    "duration": 9.081
  },
  {
    "text": "straining, I cross the flood.",
    "start": 1982.32,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "I found this really curious and",
    "start": 1988.48,
    "duration": 3.919
  },
  {
    "text": "interesting.",
    "start": 1990.799,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "I said, \"Oh, okay.\" You know, um,",
    "start": 1992.399,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I tried haunting or stand still, but I",
    "start": 1997.279,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "sank and I struggled. I tried to",
    "start": 2000.799,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "struggle straining and I got swept away.",
    "start": 2004.24,
    "duration": 8.559
  },
  {
    "text": "This is how I learned to",
    "start": 2008.88,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "not halt and not strain. Then the cross",
    "start": 2012.799,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "I crossed the flood.",
    "start": 2016.96,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "I was just um I was savoring on this",
    "start": 2019.919,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "line for quite some time and I realized",
    "start": 2022.799,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha didn't give specific to-do",
    "start": 2025.679,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "instructions. It's not like a taking",
    "start": 2029.039,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "your left foot, put this on this step",
    "start": 2031.279,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "and right do this. No, he didn't do",
    "start": 2034.48,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "that.",
    "start": 2037.919,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "What's curious is that the Buddha",
    "start": 2040.0,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "actually offered a reflection of what he",
    "start": 2043.2,
    "duration": 9.679
  },
  {
    "text": "learned in terms of effect of straining",
    "start": 2047.76,
    "duration": 10.76
  },
  {
    "text": "and the effect of halting.",
    "start": 2052.879,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "And so seems to me the Buddha was very",
    "start": 2059.52,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "attuned to his experience",
    "start": 2063.679,
    "duration": 8.561
  },
  {
    "text": "and he learned from watching being with",
    "start": 2067.119,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "meeting with his experience",
    "start": 2072.24,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "and he didn't push the experiences away.",
    "start": 2075.28,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so he was meeting in those moments",
    "start": 2079.839,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "when he tried halting and he realized,",
    "start": 2083.28,
    "duration": 7.639
  },
  {
    "text": "oh wow, I sank.",
    "start": 2087.119,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "And then the same thing when he uh",
    "start": 2091.919,
    "duration": 6.481
  },
  {
    "text": "struggled or he strained",
    "start": 2094.48,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "and he got swept away.",
    "start": 2098.4,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And notice the way he answered.",
    "start": 2102.079,
    "duration": 8.961
  },
  {
    "text": "He just described his experience",
    "start": 2106.72,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and that was it. He learned from it but",
    "start": 2111.04,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "he didn't get identified by the",
    "start": 2115.2,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "experience which happens so often to us",
    "start": 2118.24,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "that oh you know I halted I froze when",
    "start": 2122.56,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "this happened and I sank",
    "start": 2127.04,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "but then here I am you know I am a big",
    "start": 2131.44,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "failure",
    "start": 2135.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha didn't say that",
    "start": 2137.92,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "he struggled",
    "start": 2141.2,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "you got it swept away,",
    "start": 2142.96,
    "duration": 8.84
  },
  {
    "text": "but doesn't mean it's a big mistake.",
    "start": 2146.8,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so often we can pile on a lot of",
    "start": 2151.92,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "grand conclusions, our perceptions, our",
    "start": 2155.599,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "judgments",
    "start": 2158.8,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "that actually prevents us from learning",
    "start": 2160.48,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "from our experiences.",
    "start": 2164.32,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And so for the Buddha as he was attuning",
    "start": 2168.64,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "to the effect of our experience",
    "start": 2172.32,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "something else bubbles up becomes",
    "start": 2176.24,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "available to him.",
    "start": 2178.88,
    "duration": 6.239
  },
  {
    "text": "He can begin to discern",
    "start": 2182.079,
    "duration": 8.241
  },
  {
    "text": "oh by doing this it has effect on me in",
    "start": 2185.119,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "this way. Might there be a different",
    "start": 2190.32,
    "duration": 6.039
  },
  {
    "text": "choice?",
    "start": 2193.359,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so in this way, we're actually",
    "start": 2197.04,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "allowing something deeper in us to",
    "start": 2199.92,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "bubble up to make choices rather than",
    "start": 2202.88,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "our fixed views, our ideas and our",
    "start": 2207.359,
    "duration": 8.041
  },
  {
    "text": "judgment to decide for ourselves.",
    "start": 2210.079,
    "duration": 5.321
  },
  {
    "text": "And the other aspect of this uh that",
    "start": 2215.599,
    "duration": 9.52
  },
  {
    "text": "jumps out in this one line is that",
    "start": 2219.359,
    "duration": 10.24
  },
  {
    "text": "there is a lot of humility and dignity",
    "start": 2225.119,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "in what the Buddha is was practicing as",
    "start": 2229.599,
    "duration": 7.961
  },
  {
    "text": "he was crossing the flood.",
    "start": 2233.359,
    "duration": 4.201
  },
  {
    "text": "But he wasn't",
    "start": 2238.16,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "um humiliated by the thank or by the",
    "start": 2241.04,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "swept as being swept away.",
    "start": 2245.839,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "So there is humbleness in stepping one",
    "start": 2249.52,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "step at a time and learning from it",
    "start": 2254.16,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "rather than uh kind of giving in to",
    "start": 2258.88,
    "duration": 8.84
  },
  {
    "text": "being humiliated by all of that.",
    "start": 2262.64,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh I know our uh something mind, the ego",
    "start": 2268.16,
    "duration": 10.24
  },
  {
    "text": "mind uh tend to um gather the counts,",
    "start": 2272.64,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, for various reasons, you know,",
    "start": 2278.4,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and trying to get better or um or",
    "start": 2280.72,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "collapsing.",
    "start": 2284.4,
    "duration": 3.679
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh",
    "start": 2286.4,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and sometimes it counts endlessly, you",
    "start": 2288.079,
    "duration": 8.361
  },
  {
    "text": "know, oh boy, I failed a hundred times.",
    "start": 2290.4,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And that's tends to be the selfing",
    "start": 2297.52,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "strategy, you know, and then it's huff",
    "start": 2300.079,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "and puff and try to do something to fix",
    "start": 2302.8,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "it.",
    "start": 2304.96,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "But in this practice,",
    "start": 2306.64,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "it actually does not matter how many",
    "start": 2310.079,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "times I remember in a different suta",
    "start": 2312.24,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "that uh the Buddha spoke about um how",
    "start": 2316.72,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "when we're not seeing",
    "start": 2321.04,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "uh the insights into the for noble",
    "start": 2323.599,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "truth,",
    "start": 2326.64,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh he used a very specific word. He said",
    "start": 2328.48,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "you when we're not seeing things",
    "start": 2332.0,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "uh clearly with insights,",
    "start": 2335.599,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "you and I have transmigrated for a long",
    "start": 2339.28,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "time.",
    "start": 2343.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "That's enough. You don't need to know",
    "start": 2346.8,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "how many times.",
    "start": 2349.28,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "We just have a bigger orientation that",
    "start": 2352.4,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "we know.",
    "start": 2355.119,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, what is needed here is to come back",
    "start": 2357.599,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "to this moment and learning from our",
    "start": 2361.359,
    "duration": 6.441
  },
  {
    "text": "experience.",
    "start": 2364.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "When we're attuned to the experience,",
    "start": 2368.16,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "when we're attuned to uh the uh effects",
    "start": 2371.359,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "of our experiences",
    "start": 2377.04,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "uh and then being available to the",
    "start": 2380.079,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "shifting changes of it, there is a",
    "start": 2382.079,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "natural clarity that comes from within.",
    "start": 2385.44,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a inner capacity that can",
    "start": 2389.839,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "discern. Oh, this ongoing",
    "start": 2393.04,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "rage that burns, that burns me and that",
    "start": 2397.599,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "burns others.",
    "start": 2402.16,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And when that is being known, being seen",
    "start": 2404.0,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "clearly,",
    "start": 2407.44,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "it's like the hand naturally opens",
    "start": 2409.52,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "opens, not being burnt. You know, I",
    "start": 2413.52,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "don't want to hold on to that burnh",
    "start": 2416.24,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "anymore.",
    "start": 2418.4,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "So there is a naturally arising kind of",
    "start": 2419.92,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "clarity that comes from within",
    "start": 2423.599,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves. But only if we begin to see",
    "start": 2425.839,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "this very clearly and begin to be",
    "start": 2429.28,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "willing to be in this process to allow",
    "start": 2432.16,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "the clarity to come forth.",
    "start": 2435.28,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Um",
    "start": 2440.96,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "you know in our meditations sometimes I",
    "start": 2443.28,
    "duration": 8.079
  },
  {
    "text": "would notice that when uh my mind may be",
    "start": 2445.92,
    "duration": 10.159
  },
  {
    "text": "uh in a kind of unhuring and on tearing",
    "start": 2451.359,
    "duration": 10.641
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of attitude or kind of um uh",
    "start": 2456.079,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "approach",
    "start": 2462.0,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "and it was kind of steady for a while",
    "start": 2463.839,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "and then I just noticed the mind began",
    "start": 2467.2,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "to lean forward,",
    "start": 2470.48,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of wanting to reach out to the next",
    "start": 2473.839,
    "duration": 5.721
  },
  {
    "text": "moment.",
    "start": 2476.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And often",
    "start": 2480.24,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "when I'm not trying to fix that, trying",
    "start": 2482.56,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "to pull it back or trying to leap out,",
    "start": 2485.44,
    "duration": 9.96
  },
  {
    "text": "just being with this movement,",
    "start": 2490.48,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "things began to clarify itself.",
    "start": 2495.52,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And you can see, oh, this is actually",
    "start": 2498.72,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "leaving the moment.",
    "start": 2502.16,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so it's like the heart knows, oh,",
    "start": 2505.52,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "it's valuable to be meeting life here",
    "start": 2508.16,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and now, leaving the moment.",
    "start": 2510.88,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "We are losing touch with the life",
    "start": 2515.04,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "in the immediate way.",
    "start": 2518.8,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "And so that movement just kind of",
    "start": 2522.24,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "naturally fades.",
    "start": 2524.4,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "And not always. Sometimes that the",
    "start": 2527.76,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "momentum to leap out is fast. It's quick",
    "start": 2530.0,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and you might get lost for a bit",
    "start": 2533.92,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and then when you remember to come back",
    "start": 2537.68,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "in that meditation uh that we did just",
    "start": 2542.16,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "now and if you just be attuned to that",
    "start": 2544.72,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "moment you can feel the contrast.",
    "start": 2547.76,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, this losing ourselves uh losing",
    "start": 2552.079,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves with um uh connection our",
    "start": 2556.0,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "connection with the sati",
    "start": 2560.079,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "uh it actually feels like something got",
    "start": 2562.8,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "lost.",
    "start": 2565.44,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "We're losing touch with something and",
    "start": 2567.76,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "then we're coming back. There is this",
    "start": 2570.24,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of oh there is kind of wakefulness",
    "start": 2572.96,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "right in this moment. So this way we can",
    "start": 2578.079,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "begin to learn ourselves",
    "start": 2581.44,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "by the effects that our experiences on",
    "start": 2585.92,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "us",
    "start": 2589.76,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and not being diminished by the habitual",
    "start": 2594.8,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "tendencies of the floods of uh judging",
    "start": 2598.88,
    "duration": 6.959
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves, comparing ourselves. And so",
    "start": 2603.28,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "we actually have a kind of inner dignity",
    "start": 2605.839,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "in us to say, \"Yeah, this coming back to",
    "start": 2609.359,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "this moment is good enough.",
    "start": 2613.68,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "It's good enough. Doesn't need to be",
    "start": 2616.96,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "more.",
    "start": 2620.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We don't need to be some sort of a",
    "start": 2623.04,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "special person",
    "start": 2625.2,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "to cross this.",
    "start": 2628.0,
